            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Meta稱最新自研AI晶片有助降低成本 擬明年上半年部署\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cf9b9c83a2793240db38c2f9f040014a7b380ef3bd0c9c2a5846cdc15fe0dd25/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fbloomberg_chinese_traditional_757%2F7d41402d1a32740edd4bdbafcee16e43.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Meta稱最新自研AI晶片有助降低成本 擬明年上半年部署</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
