        {
            "title": "貝森特支持向美國人發放5000美元支票的提議 稱可以不影響財赤",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國財政部長<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>表示，他支持總統川普提出的如果共和黨中期選舉後在國會繼續保持多數席位，就向美國成年人發放5000美元支票的計畫。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>在周二回應議員有關該計畫的提問時表示：「我認為有辦法在不影響赤字的情況下做到這一點。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在眾議院金融服務委員會聽證會上，貝森特沒有說明如何抵消相關成本，但表示財政部已經為這一計畫籌備了「相當長一段時間」。他沒有承認此類付款很可能需要獲得國會授權。如果確實如此，貝森特表示，他將與眾議院議長邁克·約翰遜就這項提案展開合作。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-913fcfc0-363a-37e8-aa97-d6f296f107b8-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">貝森特說：「讓美國人民口袋裡有更多錢，應該是所有人的目標。」他稱總統推動這項計畫的意願「非常認真」。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這項提議預計耗資超過1萬億美元，而美國今年的支出預計將比稅收和關稅收入高出約2萬億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">參議院多數黨領袖圖恩周二也在國會大廈對記者表示，金融市場和美國債務目前的情況「確實令人擔憂」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">被問及發放5000美元支票的計畫時，圖恩表示：「在決定如何花錢時，我們必須非常審慎和明智，同時也要想方設法努力放緩政府支出的成長速度。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Bessent Says He's Supportive of $5,000 Checks for Americans</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">--聯合報導 Steven T. Dennis.</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%9D%E6%A3%AE%E7%89%B9%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%90%91%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%99%BC%E6%94%BE5000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E8%AD%B0-%E7%A8%B1%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF%E8%B2%A1%E8%B5%A4-163732240.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-16 01:11:21",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "貝森特稱美國在日圓干預行動中所花費用微不足道 但賺到數千萬美元",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國財政部長<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>表示，美國在與日本協調干預匯市、支撐日圓的行動中只投入了「微不足道」的金額，這種聯合干預行動符合美國利益。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>周二在眾議院金融服務委員會接受質詢時表示：「日圓走強有利於美國出口，日圓升值意味著日本政府不必出售美國資產來為外匯干預籌措資金。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">7月31日，在日圓兌美元跌至40年來最低水平後，美國財政部與日本一道買入日圓。日本在買入日圓的行動中投入了創紀錄的資金，這些交易涉及賣出美元，並很可能包括出售美國國債。日本是美國政府證券最大的外國持有者。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-04557af5-ff4c-355f-880b-56db417605ae-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">貝森特在聽證會上表示，我們只投入「微不足道」的金額「就能夠傳遞出支持日本政策的信號」。關注美國財政部的人士測算，財政部在此次日圓干預中動用的資金不到10億美元。相比之下，日本從7月底至8月底投入了創紀錄的964億美元。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">貝森特表示，雖然這「並不是目標」，但美國財政部在此次日圓操作中「賺了數千萬美元」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">貝森特最近幾周還暗示，希望看到日本央行通過加息來支撐日圓，他表示自己對日本貨幣政策的了解影響了干預決定。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">日本央行將在本周晚些時候召開政策會議。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Bessent Says US Yen Intervention Was 'Nominal,' Backs US Exports</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%9D%E6%A3%AE%E7%89%B9%E7%A8%B1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%A8%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%93%E5%B9%B2%E9%A0%90%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%80%E8%8A%B1%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8%E5%BE%AE%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E9%81%93-%E4%BD%86%E8%B3%BA%E5%88%B0%E6%95%B8%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-165343614.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-16 01:37:55",
